/// \defgroup grp_objects_modules Objects and modules
/// \brief Game objects and their modules: `Object`, the behavior, update,
///        body, contain, die, damage, collide, create, special power and
///        upgrade module families, and the helper modules.
///
/// An `Object` is a thing with a team, status flags and an array of
/// modules; the modules, configured from the template's INI, carry nearly
/// all of its behaviour. \ref sub_objects_modules describes the module
/// families, how objects are created, scheduled, updated, destroyed and
/// saved, the differences from Zero Hour, and what this means for modding
/// and remastering. No class pages yet: `Object` and the module base
/// classes have no canonical headers.
